# THE PRINT-AND-PLAY PDFS ARE A LOCAL BUILD, NOT A TREE FILE.
#
# jsdelivr serves every image and rulebook the TTS mod loads, and it
# refuses a package over 50 MB. The committed tree reached 55.1 MB on
# 2026-11-11 and jsdelivr began answering 403 to any path it had not
# already fetched - which is how a newly rendered die face vanished
# from the table while the old ones kept working. These four PDFs
# were 20.8 MB of that, and nothing in the mod or the lab loads them.
#
# Jon's call, 2026-11-12: they stay on his machine and are not
# published. deploy.py writes them here on every run, so a fresh
# clone rebuilds them rather than downloading them. The RULE PDFs are
# different and stay committed, in rules/ and playtest/dist/assets/.
print-and-play/
